Code differences of the Korean Platinum cartridge from US Rev 1, applied after
platinum-european-build.patch.

Korean save blocks carry their own footer magic number.

diff --git a/include/constants/savedata/savedata.h b/include/constants/savedata/savedata.h
--- a/include/constants/savedata/savedata.h
+++ b/include/constants/savedata/savedata.h
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@
 
 #define SECONDARY_FOOTER_SIZE 8
 
-#define SECTOR_SIGNATURE 0x20060623
+#define SECTOR_SIGNATURE 0x20070903
 
 #define PRIMARY_SECTOR_START 0
 #define BACKUP_SECTOR_START  64
